  "body": "After https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/955, we'll have integrated the TAO check with Fetch... somewhat. We noticed that iframes are fetched in navigation mode, so the CORS-specific flags (response tainting, tainted origin flag) will not be present when redirects occur. Any thoughts on how to deal with this problem? @yoavweiss @yutakahirano ",
